;; The compiler's own workspace (`DECISIONS.md#four-units`).
;;
;; NAMED, AND GRANTED NOTHING. The compiler reaches its host only through the
;; resolver PORT a compile is handed as an argument
;; (`DECISIONS.md#namespaces-over-the-system-port`, "the port is the
;; capability"), so it needs no `:host`. The name is what makes `^:internal`
;; mean something here: `flint.compiler.*` internals are visible to this
;; workspace and refused to every guest outside it
;; (`DECISIONS.md#namespace-is-workspace-local`).
{:flint/workspace flint/compiler}
